 {area:392}: take the small coast road south from {area:392} past the pirate camp and over a low hill; her fishing hut, with a shark strung up outside, stands by the water before the pirate ship. If you reach the ship you went too far."] = "Islen is not in Ratchet: take the small coast road south from Ratchet past the pirate camp and over a low hill; her fishing hut, with a shark strung up outside, stands by the water before the pirate ship. If you reach the ship you went too far.", ["{npc:5901}: {npc:5892}'s letter"] = "Islen Waterseer: Searn's letter", ["{npc:5901}: {npc:5906}' letter"] = "Islen Waterseer: Xanis' letter" },
