					},
				},
				{
					title = "{quest:1474}: succubus ({zone:1458})",
					note = "Back to {npc:5675} with Dalin's and Corma's hearts. He hands you the {item:6286}: go down to the summoning circle below him, stand on it and use them. Summon your voidwalker first and keep the fight on the circle, or the guards may kill her and the kill does not count. If she wins, use the hearts again; keep them, {npc:5675} takes them back.",
