				{
					title = "{quest:1846}",
					note = "The Dragonmaw orcs (level 26-30) camp in the middle of the {zone:1437}; from {area:321} in Arathi head south over the {area:881} ({area:150} is Alliance). Every Raider, Swamprunner, Centurion, Shadowwarder and Bonewarder drops a {item:7131}: right-click it to test it, and about one in four comes out sturdy, the rest break, so expect 30 or more kills for 8. You can test while moving or fighting. The orcs run for help at 15%; Raiders net you, Centurions shield-bash, Shadowwarders cast {spell:686}, Bonewarders raise skeletons.",
