				{
					title = "{area:85}: kill these as you meet them",
					note = "Greater Duskbats fly over the fields around {area:159} and along the road north.\nThe Rot Hide Graverobbers dig through the graveyards north of {area:159}; all the Rot Hides drop the ichor.\nThe Rot Hide Mongrels hold the hills further north. {npc:1753} (level 11) stands in their camp on the hill south of the shore: clear the gnolls around him first.\nThe Vile Fin murlocs line the north shore.\nThe {quest:5482} grows in the graveyard fields just north of {area:159}.\nCareful: Gnoll guards stand outside the hut and can join the fight. If you slip past them and fight him inside, he fights alone.",
