				{
					title = "Blackrock Mountain, with a group",
					note = "For The Horde! (Rend's head, {area:1583}) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city, the {faction:530} included. {area:340} in the {zone:1418} starts the Rend chain: {quest:4903}, {npc:3144}'s Wisdom, then For The Horde!. Take them when your group goes. The Spider God chain of the {zone:1458} guide ({area:978} and the {zone:1425}) pays 225 Darkspear on the way (a fifth at 60 in Classic).",
